    "turn_text": "not when it's an issue they are opposed to. But if a state make something legal and allows it within their state. Under the, you know, 10th Amendment, the federal government shouldn't be imposing on them. There's enough leeway there where the federal government, if it wants to do it, can step in. If they pass certain amendments",
